图5.4

$$
\begin{array}{r l} \iint_ {D _ {2}} \frac {x + y}{\sqrt {x ^ {2} + y ^ {2}}} \mathrm{d} x \mathrm{d} y & = \int_ {0} ^ {\pi / 2} \mathrm{d} \varphi \int_ {0} ^ {\frac {2}{\cos \varphi + \sin \varphi}} \rho (\cos \varphi + \sin \varphi) \mathrm{d} \rho \\ & = 2 \int_ {0} ^ {\pi / 2} \frac {1}{\cos \varphi + \sin \varphi} \mathrm{d} \varphi = \sqrt {2} \int_ {0} ^ {\pi / 2} \sec \left(\varphi - \frac {\pi}{4}\right) \mathrm{d} \varphi \\ & = \sqrt {2} \ln \left| \sec \left(\varphi - \frac {\pi}{4}\right) + \tan \left(\varphi - \frac {\pi}{4}\right) \right| _ {0} ^ {\pi / 2} = 2 \sqrt {2} \ln (1 + \sqrt {2}); \end{array}

\begin{array}{r l} \iint_ {D _ {3}} \frac {x + y}{\sqrt {x ^ {2} + y ^ {2}}} \mathrm{d} x \mathrm{d} y & = \int_ {\pi / 2} ^ {3 \pi / 4} \mathrm{d} \varphi \int_ {0} ^ {2} \rho (\cos \varphi + \sin \varphi) \mathrm{d} \rho \\ & = 2 (\sin \varphi - \cos \varphi) \Big | _ {\pi / 2} ^ {3 \pi / 4} = 2 (\sqrt {2} - 1). \end{array}
$$

于是

$$
\begin{array}{r l} \text {原式} & = \iint_ {D _ {1}} \frac {x + y}{\sqrt {x ^ {2} + y ^ {2}}} \mathrm{d} x \mathrm{d} y + \iint_ {D _ {2}} \frac {x + y}{\sqrt {x ^ {2} + y ^ {2}}} \mathrm{d} x \mathrm{d} y + \iint_ {D _ {3}} \frac {x + y}{\sqrt {x ^ {2} + y ^ {2}}} \mathrm{d} x \mathrm{d} y \\ & = 2 (\sqrt {2} - 1) + 2 \sqrt {2} \ln (1 + \sqrt {2}) + 2 (\sqrt {2} - 1) = 4 (\sqrt {2} - 1) + 2 \sqrt {2} \ln (1 + \sqrt {2}). \end{array}
$$
